&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full understanding of virtual servers and operating systems, block, file, and object storage, and data protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full knowledge to install and configure high availability compute solutions supporting business critical functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands how the whole picture aligns to overall Ensono strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of multiple scripting languages to develop solutions for automation and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a team to design computer system configurations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and document procedures to apply operating systems patches, code and firmware updates to systems infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in primary design meetings for Client disaster recovery planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Operating system installation procedure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement storage and data protection configurations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research system vulnerabilities and provide documentation for future use implementing corrective actions as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop guidelines and procedures for systems management including process and efficiency improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and tune systems to identify and eliminate issues and potential bottlenecks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare periodic reports related to capacity and utilization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement advanced network configurations within the virtual server configuration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree and a minimum of 8+ years of related experience or a Master&#39;s degree with 6 years of experience; or equivalent work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operating SystemsWindows 5+ years hands on administration of Windows OS environments and/or&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VMware 5+ years hands on administration of VMware environments and/or&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux 5+ years hands on administration with RHEL or other Linux environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously, to include resources, priorities, and timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results oriented team player who will work towards meeting team commitments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with system configuration automation (Scripting with Pearl/Python/Bash or DevOps tools like Chef/Puppet)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to mentor technical operations staff in appropriate technologies, as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the competitive landscape from both business and technical perspective is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS experience in designing, provisioning, monitoring and managing the environment is a big plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS Certifications such as SysOps Administrator Associate, Solutions Architect Associate and Professional ITIL Foundations Certified is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred certifications: Microsoft Certified IT Professional ﴾MCITP﴿ / Microsoft Certified Systems Engineer (MCSE) / Microsoft Certified Systems Administrator (MCSA) / Microsoft Certified Professional (MCP) / VMware Certified Professional – VCP / Red Hat Certified Engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with DevOps and Agile frameworks is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TRAVEL:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;up to 15%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
